    "strike": {
      "description": "the release, and the only one of these that is not symmetrical. It opens on the coil's last frame exactly, so the handover reads as the same motion continuing rather than a cut. The bow unwinds through neutral, past it, and settles; the barb does not come back at all, because it has left the string — it lunges a full length forward and holds there. Baked from `spent` as well, where the barb tracks have nothing to move and what plays is a bow unwinding onto nothing.",
